Package: cand
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, gcc | clang, libc6-dev
Description: C& Programming Language Native Compiler Toolchain
 C& (Cand) is an independent native programming language designed for
 high performance, AI computation, direct C interop, and clean expressive syntax.
 This package provides the compiler binary (cand) and standard libraries.
